          "name": "What does a height percentile mean?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "A height percentile tells you the share of people of the same sex and age who are shorter than you. At the 70th percentile, you are taller than about 70 out of 100 people like you."
