  <div class="tp-answer" id="quick-answer"><p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> the median U.S. man is about <strong>5&nbsp;ft&nbsp;9&nbsp;in</strong> and the median woman about <strong>5&nbsp;ft&nbsp;3.5&nbsp;in</strong>. A 6&nbsp;ft man is at about the <strong>87th percentile</strong>; a 5&nbsp;ft&nbsp;7&nbsp;in woman at about the <strong>90th</strong>.</p></div>

